        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kraft paper, bleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kraft paper, bleached, at plant
na;
Synonyms: packaging paper, Verpackungspapier, sack paper, Papiersack; 
UUID: 34858cf5-dfc3-3e40-9c72-1110ad57961b
This module includes the European production of bleached kraft paper in a non-integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, pulp handling, paper production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from one Swiss producer, used as European average data
Location: Data from one Swiss producer, used as European average data
Technology: Technology of one producer at the beginning of the 90"s
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European wrappings  2000: 3649 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_34858cf5-dfc3-3e40-9c72-1110ad57961b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
